  "dialogueList": [
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "73df8d9c-a274-48fd-98c9-2bd0d7860e83"
      },
      "name": "Dialog_MissionStart",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "好了各位，我在区域内又发现一艘空投艇，涂着 {TEAM_TAR.FactionDef.Demonym} 的标识。现在我们知道对手是谁了。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_SumireDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "杨，你对那座工厂怎么看？他们在造机甲吗？",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "那些看上去像“猎户座”的部件。等等...不，这儿只是部分启动了。不过再过几天，这场战斗就会困难<i>许多</i>。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_YangDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "那好吧，指挥官，你知道要做什么。等你做完了，梅耶尔就会就位，到这个着陆区接你。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "f22d699f-edce-4f14-b520-8580535f620f",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "4011a4c3-cba2-4d22-b2b3-3b19a3297ab9"
      },
      "name": "Dialog_MissionSuccess",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "该死，我讨厌看到所有的硬件都变成废铁。想象一下，如果我们能让六部这样的“猎户座”工作的话。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_YangDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "是啊，我正想象被他们打中的样子。指挥官，我们回家吧。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_SumireDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "d3d33d95-9ed7-4686-b9eb-954ebe51cc02"
      },
      "name": "Dialog_MissionFailure",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "该死。我只是希望他们不能让工厂一直通电。我们回轨道汇报吧，指挥官。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "5e45a01d-01a2-40bf-b4ce-c963eb32f26d"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_Interrupt_AmbushWarning",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "他们有多个单位守卫这座设施，小心别中了埋伏。",
          "wordsColor": {
